# Sample requests. Click "Send Request" above a request, or put the cursor in it and press
# Ctrl+Alt+R (Cmd+Alt+R on macOS). The response opens beside this file.
# These go to the public test services httpbin.org and jsonplaceholder.typicode.com.

@api = https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com
@echo = https://httpbin.org

### List posts of one user
# @name posts
GET {{api}}/posts?userId=1
Accept: application/json

### Read the first post from the list above (chained request)
GET {{api}}/posts/{{posts.response.body.$[0].id}}

### Create a post with a JSON body
POST {{api}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sent from VS Code",
  "body": "Request id {{$guid}} at {{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "userId": 1
}

### Form post with Basic auth (user and password are encoded for you)
POST {{echo}}/post
Authorization: Basic demo s3cret
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Ada
&role=admin

### GraphQL query
POST https://countries.trevorblades.com/
X-Request-Type: GraphQL

query Country($code: ID!) {
  country(code: $code) { name capital currency }
}

{ "code": "SE" }

### An image response is shown as an image
GET {{echo}}/image/png
